    title "Is This the End of the Road for Ridgid Cordless Tools?"
    description "Is This the End of the Road for Ridgid Cordless Tools?&amp;#10;They dropped brushed tools, they dropped Octane, they dropped Jobmax and they dropped 12V.  They can't seem to figure out who they want to be, stuck between Milwaukee and Ryobi. Their next/last try is to take on Makita, DeWALT, and M12 in the subcompact space? This could be the end of the road for Ridgid. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support the Den Of Tools:&amp;#10;Mugs &amp;#38; Shirts: bit.ly/3fZcpCP&amp;#10;Stickers &amp;#38; Books: www.denoftools.com/shop&amp;#10;Become a Member: bit.ly/31m3jVY&amp;#10;PayPal: www.denoftools.com/paypal&amp;#10;BitCoin: 3M3eH9Lyjo9XPjsUZ5LY9SWWeUJuCc4nqT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect:&amp;#10;Den of Deals: https://bit.ly/2ZqtQXp&amp;#10;Bear's Den: www.youtube.com/bearsdenchannel&amp;#10;Website: www.DenOfTools.com&amp;#10;Facebook: www.facebook.com/groups/denoftools&amp;#10;Instagram: www.instagram.com/denoftools&amp;#10;Reddit: www.reddit.com/r/DenofTools&amp;#10;Discord: discord.gg/TaT9s6R&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Favorites:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sorry, we don't talk about how we do &amp;#34;The Bear&amp;#34;.  &amp;#10;Email: DoT@red-beard.com (Business Questions Only)&amp;#10;Mailing Address?  This part is tricky.  We bounce back and forth between Montana and Las Vegas.  Please contact us to make sure where we will be.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Montana:  PO BOX 76, Livingston, MT 59047&amp;#10;Nevada: 2251 N Rampart BLVD, Suite 177, Las Vegas, NV 89128&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Just assume all links are affiliate links they might not be but at this point who cares."
