    title "MAKING A KNIFE WITH NO POWER TOOLS!!! PART 1"
    description "GET T-SHIRTS: http://alecsteeleshop.com/&amp;#10;FOLLOW ON INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/alecsteele/&amp;#10;LEARN BLACKSMITHING ONLINE: http://beginblacksmithing.com/&amp;#10;PATREON: https://www.patreon.com/alecsteele&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;AMAZON AFFILIATE LINKS TO GEAR I LIKE: &amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;CAMERA + MAIN LENS: http://amzn.to/2CrLyYP&amp;#10;WIDE LENS: http://amzn.to/2CsAZou&amp;#10;TRIPOD: http://amzn.to/2GpBX7f&amp;#10;MIC: http://amzn.to/2CrBmiQ&amp;#10;SD CARD: http://amzn.to/2sF0i7g&amp;#10;COMPUTER: http://amzn.to/2C4i0oo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BEST HAND CREAM http://amzn.to/2Bz4tnL&amp;#10;LOTS OF SHARPIES: http://amzn.to/2CsDwyR&amp;#10;FAVOURITE PEN: http://amzn.to/2Ho4jQI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Seriously, be very concerned about your health. Much cheaper to buy these things now than perish 20 years too soon or worse. &amp;#10;YOU NEED THIS AT ALL TIMES (Tourniquet): http://amzn.to/2Cuwp9m&amp;#10;PUT THIS IN YOUR SHOP NOW (Trauma kit): http://amzn.to/2Glii8y&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WELDING HOOD + POWERED RESPIRATOR: http://amzn.to/2ENWV2E&amp;#10;GRINDING HELMET + POWERED RESPIRATOR: http://amzn.to/2EKsSZI&amp;#10;GRINDING HELMET (works with both powered respirators, buy plenty disposable screen protectors): http://amzn.to/2F9aZRU&amp;#10;HALF MASK RESPIRATOR (BEST ON MARKET): http://amzn.to/2HoFqV9&amp;#10;FILTERS: http://amzn.to/2FaSLzp&amp;#10;EARMUFFS FOR HELMET: http://amzn.to/2Hq0IkT&amp;#10;GLOVES I LIKE TO GRIND IN: http://amzn.to/2HlsNdn&amp;#10;EARMUFFS: http://amzn.to/2Byqza0&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/alecsteele&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM @alecsteele&amp;#10;FACEBOOK PAGE  https://www.facebook.com/alecsteeleblacksmith/&amp;#10;SNAPCHAT @ALEC-STEELE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My name is Alec Steele and I am a 20 year old blacksmith from Norfolk in the United Kingdom. I upload a vlog from my day at the workshop almost every single day. Lots of sparks, lots of making, lots of fantastic-ness. Great to have you here following along!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What do I make? LOTS of Damascus steel, knives, swords, axes and more and of course, I always love hearing your suggestions for future projects in the comments below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So if you want to see lots of forging fun, blacksmithing badassery, cinematic hammering and more in my Daily Vlog (#Daily_Steele) - please subscribe here by hitting that red button! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FACEBOOK PAGE  https://www.facebook.com/alecsteeleblacksmith/&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM @alecsteele&amp;#10;SNAPCHAT @ALEC-STEELE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music by http://www.epidemicsound.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Alec Steele Blacksmith 2018"
