    label "jVcpFJ1L3aM"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-03T15:00:31Z"
    title "What is a PRO Tool? Power Tools for Professionals"
    description "Whether you&amp;#8217;re in the field doing electrical, plumbing, or general contractor work, or you&amp;#8217;re just a DIY builder that wants to get started on a new grilling deck or a treehouse for the boys, there&amp;#8217;s one common denominator. We all use power tools. Being a multi-billion dollar industry, everyone wants to get in on the action. We all know the brands, Milwaukee, DeWalt, Makita, FLEX, Skil, Kobalt, Ridgid, the list goes on and on. The age-old question is &amp;#8220;What tool do I need?&amp;#8221; and we&amp;#8217;re here to help clear that up for you. Kenny, Clint, and Tom dive into the differences between tool brand and tool levels based on performance, ergonomics, practicality, and of course, price and value. Let&amp;#8217;s talk about it!  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#PowerTools #ProTools #DoItYourself&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe and click on the bell to see new videos weekly: https://bit.ly/3cZUQzi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Give us a like on Facebook!  https://www.facebook.com/protoolreviews/&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Follow us on Instagram! https://www.instagram.com/protoolreviews/"
