    label "FID-BoSrzWQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-05T08:45:00Z"
    title "Should you buy Milwaukee power tools? 2 years experience review"
    description "This is a review of my overall experience over a 2 year period  using the Milwaukee m18 power tools. In this video I briefly run through 13 tools which I use on a daily basis to discuss any pros and cons that I have experienced during this time. Milwaukee power tools are known to be nothing but heavy duty and over I can definitely attest to that.  Beware though, once you invest and buy Milwaukee it become addictive.  If you would like to see more in depth reviews and demonstrations on how to use these tools and where they are used individually let me know in the comment section. For more DIY and how to videos LIKE, COMMENT and SUBSCRIBE.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your donations help me to keep helping you .....&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=M3JK8MDR9NYB8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Amazon product links U.S -&amp;#10;Milwaukee power tools combo kit - https://amzn.to/3wrrbIm&amp;#10;Milwaukee packout backpack - https://amzn.to/3wratcf&amp;#10;Milwaukee fastback utility knife/blade - https://amzn.to/3rJPFJu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Amazon product links Australia - &amp;#10;Milwaukee power tools combo kit - https://amzn.to/3fDDStT&amp;#10;Milwaukee packout backpack - https://amzn.to/3sREoIu&amp;#10;Milwaukee fastback utility knife/blade - https://amzn.to/3rJPFJu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DIY #howto #billshowto"
