    id 116
    label "RmNMfRC_7qM"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-20T11:00:13Z"
    title "Evolution Power Tools TV - Ep. 1 | Self build coffee table  van life"
    description "Learn how to be a maker, woodworker, DIY and self build expert. Get inspired with Evolution Power Tools TV. Find out how to build a coffee table, discover van life and meet The Carpenter's Daughter in Episode 1. Hosted by Joe Whittaker of Average Joe's Joinery.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.............................................................&amp;#10;//LINKS TO MORE GREAT CONTENT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;  WH Creations (Will Head) 4-part guide to building a coffee table-&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/coffeetable&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Campervans en le Frith (Adam Lincoln) a day in the life video - &amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Vikkie Lee (The Carpenter's Daughter) full interview - &amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/vikkie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Evolution Power Tools Tracksaw - full video guide&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/tracksaw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...........................................................&amp;#10;//COMPETITIONS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127942;  Picture contest link - http://evolutiontv.co/piccomp&amp;#10;&amp;#127942; Main competition link - http://evolutiontv.co/maincomp&amp;#10;&amp;#127942; Like and share competition link - http://evolutiontv.co/likecomp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//SUBSCRIBE TO EVOLUTION POWER TOOLS TV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; http://evolutiontv.co/sub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;..........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//VISIT THE EVOLUTION POWER TOOLS WEBSITE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; http://evolutiontv.co/site&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//CHECK OUT OUR FRIENDS FROM THE SHOW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Joe's YouTube Channel&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/AJYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Joe on Instagram&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/AJIG&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit The Carpenter's Daughter YouTube Channel&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CDYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit The Carpenter's Daughter on Instagram&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CDIG&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit WH Creations on YouTube&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/WHYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Adam's website&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CVEF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;//CHAPTERS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;02:20 WH Creations - Workshop tour&amp;#10;09:07 Campervans En Le Frith - Van life feature&amp;#10;14:49 The Carpenter's Daughter - Interview&amp;#10;20:21 Track saw guide&amp;#10;24:28 Competitions&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Joe Whittaker of Average Joe's Joinery has teamed up with Evolution Power Tools to bring you a new show all about being a maker and woodworker, DIY and power tools. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are going to be posting a brand new episode of Evolution Power Tools TV every month so make sure you subscribe to the channel and turn that bell notification on, to guarantee you never miss any new content. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Let&amp;#8217;s take a look at what&amp;#8217;s coming up on this episode.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;First up, Will from WH creations is going to give us a tour of his workshop and show us his incredible handiwork. We also have link to Will&amp;#8217;s fantastic guide to building a coffee table so make sure you check that out as well.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Next we spend a day in the life of Adam from Campervans-en-le-frith and he tells us about how he got started customising vans. We also have a link to a great video of Adam showing us how he works on his projects so be sure to click through and give that a watch.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Later on I will be  joined, in the studio, by Vikkie, AKA &amp;#8216;The carpenter&amp;#8217;s daughter&amp;#8217; and she will take on a journey through her creations, he YouTube channel and her motives and methods. We also have a link to our full interview with Vikkie so check that out when you get the chance.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After that, we will be getting more technical with Evolution Power Tool&amp;#8217;s very own Lee Price, who will show us how to correctly setup and use a track saw. As a Senior Designer for Evolution Power Tools, Lee really knows his stuff so make sure you keep watching. We also have a link to the full track saw guide.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Finally, it&amp;#8217;s competition time. Megan will take a look at your recent creations and announce whose project has won some great prizes and we&amp;#8217;ll also be launching our big prize competition.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you want to take part in our picture competition, all you have to do is post a picture, on Instagram, of something that you have made recently. Make sure you use the hastag: #EvolutionTV or your picture may be missed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Next month, for our April 2022 episode, we will be giving away a one night stay for two as our picture competition prize. The One Night Stay Collection offers the lucky recipient a choice of relaxing hotel breaks for two with breakfast included. There is a great choice of options, all across the UK.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Remember, if you&amp;#8217;re watching this after April 2022, the competition will be closed. You can, however, still take part. Click the competition link in the description, to see the latest prizes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You could be in for a chance of winning a Smeg Espresso Coffee Machine with a recommended retail price of &amp;#163;319.95. All you have to do is answer the following, very simple question.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click the competition link in the description to answer the question. We will then choose a winner, at random, from all of the entries and announce who has won on the next episode.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Evolution power tools TV is packed with features to inspire you with DIY and your home workshop.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join Evolution Tv at maker's central in 2022."
