    step 0
    date "2021-09-10T13:16:12Z"
    title "Can you buy good power tools in Russia? See what we find when we go tool shopping!!"
    description "We find out what tools you can buy in Russia. What brands are available here? Makita, Milwaukee, Dewalt, Metabo, Stihl, Bosch, Stanley.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to support our family on our new adventure, click the link below:&amp;#10;https://paypal.me/BearlyRussian &amp;#10;or&amp;#10;&amp;#1045;&amp;#1089;&amp;#1083;&amp;#1080; &amp;#1074;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1084; &amp;#1085;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1074;&amp;#1080;&amp;#1090;&amp;#1089;&amp;#1103; &amp;#1084;&amp;#1086;&amp;#1081; &amp;#1084;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1090;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1080;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1083; &amp;#1080; &amp;#1074;&amp;#1099; &amp;#1093;&amp;#1086;&amp;#1090;&amp;#1080;&amp;#1090;&amp;#1077; &amp;#1089;&amp;#1076;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1083;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1090;&amp;#1100; &amp;#1084;&amp;#1085;&amp;#1077; &amp;#1087;&amp;#1086;&amp;#1076;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1086;&amp;#1082;:&amp;#10;&amp;#1095;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1079; &amp;#1057;&amp;#1073;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1073;&amp;#1072;&amp;#1085;&amp;#1082;: +8-992-115-3640&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are an Australian family who sold everything and moved to Russia, to start our new adventure. We hope to buy some land and build a new homestead in the Siberian Altai mountains of Russia. As a family we love doing things together, we work hard and play hard. Our faith, family and freedom is very important to us and shapes the way we live. Some of our favourite activities are off-roading, homesteading, spending time with pets and animals of all types. We love building and construction and of course tools. We built our farm in Australia from the ground up and are looking forward to starting a new debt free homestead in Russia. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out some of our family's other channels:&amp;#10;&amp;#10; @Russia Guy   - My son's channel&amp;#10; @RussianHomesteadGirl     - My daughter's channel&amp;#10; @Backyard Russia   - My son in-law's channel"
