    id 136
    label "CuG7QOy7ovI"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-15T16:01:29Z"
    title "How To Choose A Power Tool Brand"
    description "In this video I talk through what I believe are the four &amp;#34;levels&amp;#34; of power tool brands based on price. This is based on my opinion and experiences - if you disagree with anything please do let me know in the comments, I'm keen to hear your thoughts.  I also discuss corded vs cordless, brushed vs brushless and how to choose a tool brand to invest in.    &amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Intro&amp;#10;0:11 Cheap Brands&amp;#10;1:29 Prosumer Brands&amp;#10;2:29 Trade Grade Brands&amp;#10;4:33 Premium Brands&amp;#10;5:36 Cordless Or Corded?&amp;#10;7:12 How To Choose A Tool Brand&amp;#10;7:40 Brushless or Brushed Motors?&amp;#10;8:10 Do You Really Get What You Pay For?&amp;#10;8:43 Secondhand Market&amp;#10;9:00 Sponsored Message&amp;#10;9:30 What I Use&amp;#10;10:29 Outro&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This video is sponsored by www.ITS.co.uk, all the tools you need to get the job done.  ITS have their own kit builder tool where you can select the tools you need and get a discount.  If you use the code RAGNBONE at checkout, you'll recieve a free goodie bundle.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Recommended Tool Performance Comparison Videos&amp;#10;Oz Tool Talk https://www.youtube.com/c/OZToolTalk&amp;#10;Tools &amp;#38; Stuff https://www.youtube.com/c/ToolsStuff/videos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Mirka Sander Fault (Vlog)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WNPD_6-Gdmw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128308;My channel is supported by Milwaukee&amp;#128308;&amp;#10;Check out their full range here: https://uk.milwaukeetool.eu/?utm_source=Social&amp;#38;utm_medium=YouTube&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Rag%20N%20Bone%20Brown%20-Milwaukee%20Range&amp;#10;Tools used in this video: &amp;#10;M18 Mitre Saw https://uk.milwaukeetool.eu/en-gb/m18-fuel-254-mm-mitre-saw/m18-fms254/?utm_source=Social&amp;#38;utm_medium=YouTube&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Rag%20N%20Bone%20Brown%20-%20Mitre%20Saw&amp;#10;M18 Router https://uk.milwaukeetool.eu/en-gb/m18-fuel-trim-router/m18-ftr/?utm_source=Social&amp;#38;utm_medium=YouTube&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Rag%20N%20Bone%20Brown%20-%20router&amp;#10;M18 Drill &amp;#38; Driver https://uk.milwaukeetool.eu/en-gb/m18-fuel-powerpack/m18-fpp2a2/?utm_source=Social&amp;#38;utm_medium=YouTube&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Rag%20N%20Bone%20Brown%20-%20M18%20twin%20kit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#woodworking #tools #powertools&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching! Please subscribe, click like if you like, and hit the bell icon for future video notifications&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128296; MY TOOLS &amp;#128296;&amp;#10;For links to the tools I use, plus some of my favourite consumables,  finishes and more see links below.  Please note I earn a small commission from any purchases:&amp;#10;UK affiliate store: https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;US affiliate store: https://www.amazon.com/shop/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129309; HELP SUPPORT THE CHANNEL &amp;#129309;&amp;#10;Support with YouTube channel membership: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVyE_6jEtVZGmYGXtUOL5FQ/join&amp;#10;Support with Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;Support with PayPal https://paypal.me/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;Shop With Amazon using my affiliate link: https://geni.us/iWD3K&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128176; SHOP &amp;#128176;&amp;#10;Etsy: https://www.etsy.com/uk/shop/KeithBrownMaker&amp;#10;https://teespring.com/stores/rag-n-bone-brown-merch&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127911; WORKSHOP BANTER PODCAST &amp;#127911; &amp;#10;https://youtube.com/workshopbanter&amp;#10;Also available on Spotify, Apple, Google and most other podcast platforms&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128279; LINKS: &amp;#128279;&amp;#10;Website: https://www.ragnbonebrown.com&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;Instagram: @ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/ragnbonebrown&amp;#10;Email: ragnbonebrown@gmail.com&amp;#10;Second YouTube Channel (non woodwork videos): https://www.youtube.com/user/keefykeef"
