    title "Bosch Connected Power Tools App Technology Preview"
    description "The Bosch Toolbox app is about to gain a lot more features with new Bosch Connected Power Tools which allow you to customize features like speed, LED brightness, torque control, and more. Bosch is debuting the technology with an LED work light in January, but will follow up with several tools in September of 2017. These include a new Brute Tough hammer drill, drill/driver, and angle grinder.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The new Bosch connected tools use a communications module that not only provides these new connected features, but also facilitates tool tracking via Bluetooth. Lots more info to come, but this technology seems promising to say the least."
