    description "Different kinds of power tools and their uses. These power tools are really useful for DIY projects, for making or building any furniture piece, and any other job at home or at work.&amp;#10;Sa video na ito ay ie-explain ko kung paano gamitin ang mga power tools na ito mga kaps, and because we  have reached 1000 subscribers, I want to take this chance to thank you all&amp;#10;#Stayathome&amp;#10;#SaveLives&amp;#10;#powertools&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Where to buy these power tools? &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/2vnfVS3dOc4&amp;#10;for inquiries, just leave your coment down below and subscribe to my channel..&amp;#128522;&amp;#10;Other woodworking videos here&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a center table &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/nqxlRRp8Inc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to Build a Bedside Table &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/aN4ikj7LL_U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to make a raised Panel door design &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/7ElFLOVAE0I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a dining table &amp;#128073;  https://youtu.be/DgPJxmzIhZM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a picture Frame &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/BLe47CDpoDg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to build french type door for cabinets &amp;#128073;https://youtu.be/LAqDsekCyi8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to build a rocking chair   &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/x4QFnQ_WM-o&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to build a door jamb &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/MYHrfzhFa8o&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to shrapen a crosscut saw &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/VXxVFSajU6A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a king size Bed &amp;#128073;  https://youtu.be/phqM-tL7YrI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a solid dresser cabinet &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/-gBpYF7Sg2U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make wider boards &amp;#128073;  https://youtu.be/EjakXPR0xoM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make a hanging cabinet &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/va5R0pWPfgM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;how to make dining chairs &amp;#128073; https://youtu.be/IOcihFL85Dc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;h