    id 164
    label "oGZnhJL2Z50"
    step 0
    date "2019-11-23T14:00:11Z"
    title "SKIL 12V And 20V Power Tools Are NOT WHAT I EXPECTED (i cant believe it)"
    description "SKIL 12V And 20V Power Tools Are NOT WHAT I EXPECTED, I can't believe it and I'm pretty sure you won't either! On our trip to Nashville for the STAFDA event we got the chance to see some new SKIL 12V and 20V tools that I have never been able to test before. In this video we try out the 12V drill/driver and impact driver, we also try out some 20V tools like the oscillating tool. After testing these tools and getting a good feel for them I can tell you without a doubt that these tools are quality and not what I expected! This is one of those situations where you need to try it to believe it, hopefully this video will help illustrate the power of SKIL tools. Let us know in the comments section if you would like us to further test these new SKIL tools and which tools you would like too see. Should we have some SKIL tools in a TTR?"
