  [
    id 165
    label "ygZnZ2BK0hI"
    step 0
    date "2018-02-16T19:18:49Z"
    title "Ridgid Cordless Power Tools Review"
    description "Ridgid 18 volt cordless tools review. Are the Ridgid Cordless power tools the best in the business?  These are the cordless brushless power tools that I own. The main thing that sold me on the Ridgid line was the Ridgid lifetime warranty.  But is that enough to make me keep these tools long term?  This is not an all inclusive Ridgid Power Tools review.  These are the 5th Gen brushless tools. I talk about the following Ridgid cordless tools: The Ridgid Gen5x combo kit including the Ridgid Impact Driver R86037 and Ridgid Drill R86116.  I bought the Ridgid Router R86044 separately.  Then I got the Ridgid Cordless Brad Nailer R09890. I've owned these cordless tools for about 8 or 9 months at the time of this video.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Are these tools made for the everyday worker? Or are they better suited for the weekend warrior or occasional DIYer?  I talk about this and more in this video.  My favorite tool out of the four that I own is by far the Ridgid Cordless Brad nailer.   What tools are you using? &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links to some of the tools discussed in this video (Amazon Affiliate Links)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Buy your Ridgid Tools here: https://go.magik.ly/ml/zkbs/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#teamridgid #ridgidcordless #ridgidtools"
