    title "Milwaukee Electrical Tools - Electricians Showcase"
    description "Electrical work requires specialised tools.  In this video, we look at the range of unique offerings from Milwaukee specifically designed for electricians. Each item is time stamped and linked below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also, you can request a job site demonstration in Australia, with any of these specialise tools here https://www.milwaukeetool.com.au/jobsite-solutions/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Special thanks to&amp;#10;Sparkyvos :&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/sparkyvos/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Addicted to Tools:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/addictedtotools/&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/addictedtotools&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgLVFSmfbLg5G4wuzOq-bNQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee Tools Australia:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/milwaukeetoolsaus/&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/MilwaukeeToolsAustralia&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/MilwaukeeToolsAu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Featured Tools:&amp;#10;0:12 - M18 Cordless Cable Stripper M18BCS-0C - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18bcs0c-18v-liion-cordless-cable-stripper-skin-only&amp;#10;0:33 - M18 Cordless FORCELOGIC&amp;#8482; &amp;#13;ONE-KEY&amp;#8482; 300mm&amp;#178; Crimper M18HCCT-0C - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18hcct0c-18v-liion-cordless-forcelogic-onekey-300mm2-crimper-skin-only&amp;#10;0:58 - M12 Cordless&amp;#13;Cable Cutters M12CC-0 - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m12cc-0-12v-li-ion-cordless-cable-cutters-skin-only&amp;#10;1:18 - M18 Brushless&amp;#13;Threaded Rod Cutter M18BLTRC-0X - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18bltrc0-18v-liion-cordless-brushless-threaded-rod-cutter-skin-only&amp;#10;1:38 - M18 Cordless 6-Ton&amp;#13; KNOCKOUT&amp;#8482; Tool M18HKP-201C - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18hkp-201c-18v-2-0ah-li-ion-cordless-force-logic-knockout-tool-combo-kit&amp;#10;2:03 - Milwaukee Fish Sticks and Tapes https://sydneytools.com.au/category/electrical/cable-pulling?filters=%7B%22brand%22%3A%5B%22Milwaukee%22%5D%7D&amp;#38;p=1&amp;#10;3:08 -  M18 Cordless 7.5L&amp;#13;Wet &amp;#38; Dry Vacuum Cleaner M18WDV-0 - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18wdv0-18v-liion-cordless-75l-wet-dry-vacuum-cleaner-skin-only&amp;#10;3:26 - M12 Soldering Iron M12SI-0 and M18 Cordless Heat Gun M18BHG-0&amp;#10;https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m12si-0-12v-li-ion-cordless-soldering-iron-skin-only&amp;#10;https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-m18bhg-0-18v-li-ion-cordless-heat-gun-skin-only&amp;#10;3:38 - Milwaukee Lighting Solutions - Featured&amp;#10;https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-hlsf-450lm-spot-flood-headlamp&amp;#10;https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-flled-300-lumen-magnetic-flood-light&amp;#10;https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-ipl-led-penlight&amp;#10;4:10 - Milwaukee PACKOUT&amp;#8482; Range - https://sydneytools.com.au/category/by-brand/milwaukee/packout&amp;#10;4:30 - Electricians Tool Pouch - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-48228112-electrician-s-work-pouch&amp;#10;4:41- 18pce HOLEDOZER&amp;#8482; Electricians Hole saw set - https://sydneytools.com.au/product/milwaukee-49224097-18pce-hole-dozer-electricians-hole-saw-kit&amp;#10;All featured Accessories and much much more https://sydneytools.com.au/category/by-brand/milwaukee"
