    title "Power Tools: How to drill into a brick wall"
    description "Helen shows how to hang a picture on a brick wall.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;She goes through what you'll need to complete this task, including how to find the right size screw and wall plug. If you are not yet confident using a drill, this is the perfect tutorial to start with.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHAT IS POWER TOOLS?&amp;#10;Power Tools is a series of household DIY videos made by women, for women. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;These fun, approachable and concise videos give instructions on basic DIY tasks like changing a lightbulb, smashing a window, painting a wall and using a drill.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The videos are part of a project by award-winning arts and social justice organisation Idle Women and were all made in St Helens, Merseyside, UK.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Find out more: https://www.everywomanpower.tools/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cover image: Jessie Leong"
