    date "2017-11-06T22:57:05Z"
    title "Makita DLS110Z - Power Tools in ACTION"
    description "The Makita DLS110Z 10&amp;#34; Cordless Brushless Sliding Compound Mitre Saw is Built for You with the ability to Accept TWO (2) 18 VOLT Li-Ion Batteries without a converter for use with existing Makita 18V Batteries.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Learn more in Store &amp;#38; Online at https://www.calfast.com/search?sa=all&amp;#38;controller=search&amp;#38;orderby=position&amp;#38;orderway=desc&amp;#38;search_query=Makita+DLS110Z&amp;#38;submit_search.x=0&amp;#38;submit_search.y=0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;350 cuts (through 2x4 Wood) PER CHARGE!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The DLS110Z Corldess Miter Saw is Built with a Rail Forward Design enabling the saw to be placed against wall to maximize effective workspace!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Includes a 3 stage gear reduction system that greatly increases cutting capacity on vertical baseboard or nested crown molding.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1-3/16&amp;#34; guide rail diameter provides increased stability and cutting precision&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Integrated guide fence and lower fence increases rigidity and support of materials and allows fence to be secured to holders to prevent damage and/or loss.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The front bevel knob enables easy adjustment without reaching for operator convenience and precise setting of bevel angle.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Includes a large miter table built for use with wide materials and an easy to operate mitre angle lock with free spin releasing lever and locking lever.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Improved dust collection with dual dust collection ports!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Miter Saw's Ergonomic Horizontal Soft Rubber Grip design for vibration absorption and comfortable operation.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Feel free to use this footage in your own works! Just make sure you clear the Makita logo, or remove it in post."
