  [
    id 384
    label "f4FvUEQ1ZLM"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-09T19:00:12Z"
    title "How Do Batteries Cells Affect Power Tools? Milwaukee HD vs High Output Packs"
    description "We've received lots of questions lately regarding new battery cell technology. One question was how do battery cells affect power tools. Do they only increase run-time or are there real power gains to be had by using newer packs. When it comes to packs that use 21700 cells instead of 18650 cells, the fact of the matter is these new packs can truly output more power.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This makes many existing cordless power tools able to do more. With newer cordless tools that take advantage of that power, the effects are even more impressive. We test this using a couple tools using Milwaukee RedLithium batteries, an HD pack, and their new High Output batteries. Enjoy this Thursday Throwdown where we pit the Milwaukee RedLithium CP 2.0 Ah battery against the Milwaukee High Output CP3.0 Ah pack (with 21700 cells).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;See our article on 18650 vs 21700 cells: http://bit.ly/2m8YL6h"
    channeltitle "Pro Tool Reviews"
    channelid "UCnhVT54G9kNquwT1_d2ZGQw"
