    title "NEW M12 Fuel Drill and Impact Driver | Milwaukee 3404  3453"
    description "Milwaukee Pipeline gave us a sneak peek at their upcoming drill and impact driver additions to the M12 Fuel power tool line. The 3404-22 hammer drill now has 400 in-lbs and exceeds what you can find on some compact 18V/20V Max drills. The 3453-22 is their impact driver upgrade, which features 10% more speed, while also getting upgrades in torque and a new tri-beam LED. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#milwaukeetool #reviews #tools &amp;#10;&amp;#10;READ MORE&amp;#10;HAMMER DRILL: https://bit.ly/3PnRtnC&amp;#10;IMPACT DRIVER: https://bit.ly/3nZVX8r&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe and click on the bell to see new videos weekly: https://bit.ly/3cZUQzi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Give us a like on Facebook!  https://www.facebook.com/protoolreviews/&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Follow us on Instagram! https://www.instagram.com/protoolreviews/"
