  [
    id 516
    label "jIeP2BlIWN0"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-24T10:00:13Z"
    title "Evolution Power Tools TV - Ep. 2 | Woodwork, Men Sean Evelegh"
    description "Learn how to be a maker, expert at woodwork, DIY and self build expert. Get inspired with Evolution Power Tools TV. Find out how to build a pet feeder, discover Eastleigh men's shed and meet fine furniture maker, Sean Evelegh in Episode 2. Plus, see the NEW cordless power tools range. Hosted by Joe Whittaker of Average Joe's Joinery.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.............................................................&amp;#10;//LINKS TO MORE GREAT CONTENT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;  Create2Make (Paul Willmore) 2-part guide to building a pet feeder -&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CTM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Introducing Eastleigh Men's Shed - &amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/EMS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Sean Evelegh (SE Woodwork) full interview - &amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/SeanE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Evolution Power Tools NEW Cordless mitre saws - full video guide&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CORDLESS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...........................................................&amp;#10;//COMPETITIONS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127942;  Picture competition link - http://evolutiontv.co/piccomp&amp;#10;&amp;#127942; Main competition link - http://evolutiontv.co/maincomp&amp;#10;&amp;#127942; Like &amp;#38;. share competition link - http://evolutiontv.co/likecomp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;...........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//SUBSCRIBE TO EVOLUTION POWER TOOLS TV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; http://evolutiontv.co/sub&amp;#10;&amp;#10;..........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//VISIT THE EVOLUTION POWER TOOLS WEBSITE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; http://evolutiontv.co/site&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//CHECK OUT OUR FRIENDS FROM THE SHOW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Joe's YouTube Channel&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/AJYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Joe on Instagram&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/AJIG&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Sean Evelegh's YouTube Channel&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/SEYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Sean Evelegh on Instagram&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/SEIG&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit Create2Make on YouTube&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/CTMYT&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Visit The Eastleigh Men's shed website&amp;#10;http://evolutiontv.co/EMSWS&amp;#10;Visit the UK Mens Shed Association&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;http://evolutiontv.co/sheds&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;//CHAPTERS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;03:03 Create2Make - Home workshop&amp;#10;09:23 Introducing Eastleigh Men's Shed&amp;#10;14:51 Sean Evelegh - Interview&amp;#10;20:02 NEW Cordless mitre saws&amp;#10;23:45 Competitions&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.........................................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Joe Whittaker of Average Joe's Joinery has teamed up with Evolution Power Tools to bring you a new show all about being a maker and woodworker, DIY and power tools.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;re posting a new episode of Evolution Power Tools TV every month so make sure you subscribe to the channel and turn that bell notification on, to guarantee you never miss any new content. New makers central content coming soon. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;First up, Paul Willmore from the YouTube channel Create2Make shows us his in-house workshop and some of the projects he&amp;#8217;s worked on. Paul&amp;#8217;s also created a guide to building your own pet feeder so make sure you click through to watch his in-depth guide to the next level in pet dinner-ware.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After that, we visit Eastleigh Men&amp;#8217;s sheds to find out what a group of retired craftsmen, avid DIYers and ex-trademen do in their spare time behind closed shed doors &amp;#8230; interested, you should be as there are 100s of these organisations around the country, all of whom offer help and support to home DIYers on their own journeys to DIY independence. So if you want to tap into literally 100s of years of real hands on experience all on your doorstep, tune in to this special feature. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Now from retired craftsmen to our homegrown YouTube supremo, designer and fine furniture maker Sean Eveleigh, who is taking the world by storm creating beautiful wooden furniture. I&amp;#8217;ll be asking him about his process and inspiration. Make sure you watch and click through to my full Q&amp;#38;A. And make sure you join us for makers central. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;And before we get into competition time with Megan, Senior Product Designer Lee Price unveils Evolution Power Tools new range of cordless products. Taking Evolutions patent Multimaterial cutting technology to a whole new level of flexibility by adding cordless technology &amp;#8211; so not only cutting Anything, but cutting Anything Anywhere with cordless. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I hope Lee&amp;#8217;s preview of the Evolution Power Tools cordless mitre saws has inspired you to want to see more. If so click the link in the description to see more from Lee. He will unbox the new cordless mitre saws, assemble and calibrate them and compare them with our older, corded models. He&amp;#8217;ll also show you a quick project using the new cordless mitre saws.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There is now a great range of Evolution cordless power tools to explore. Make sure you check out the Evolution Power Tools website to see the full range of cordless power tools.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We'll see you all at maker's central in 2022."
    channeltitle "Evolution Power Tools"
